{"id":"n63968-1-9","stage":1,"title":"손바닥 · 手掌","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63968-1-9-1","ko":"내 연주회 어땠어?","zh":"我的演奏会怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연주회","meaning":"演奏会","explanation":"연주회：演奏会","readings":[{"term":"연주회","audio":"/audio/cbb658613017a442e2f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67766","senseId":"1","lemma":"연주회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"cbb658613017a442","term":"연주회","zh":"演奏会","audio":"/audio/cbb658613017a442e2f4.mp3","entryId":"67766","definition":"给听众演奏音乐的聚会。","pronunciation":["연ː주회","연ː주훼"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0885946b6cbd1f6e9824.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63968-1-9-2","ko":"정말 훌륭했어. 사람들이 손바닥이 닳도록 연신 박수를 치더라.","zh":"很精彩，大家一个劲儿鼓掌，手掌都快拍破了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"훌륭했어.","meaning":"优秀，卓越","explanation":"훌륭하다：优秀，卓越；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"훌륭하다","audio":"/audio/086a96db168cd21a589e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73249","senseId":"1","lemma":"훌륭하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손바닥이","meaning":"手掌","explanation":"손바닥：手掌；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손바닥","audio":"/audio/bc59214ffbb2f1d41afe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63968","senseId":"1","lemma":"손바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"닳도록","meaning":"磨破","explanation":"닳다：磨破；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"닳다","audio":"/audio/5c386e3250158aff8a8a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44167","senseId":"1","lemma":"닳다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연신","meaning":"不断地、一个劲儿地","explanation":"연신：不断地、一个劲儿地","readings":[{"term":"연신","audio":"/audio/0362ecbd1b937a469a24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:연신:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"연신","origin":"course-authored supplement"}]},{"text":"박수를","meaning":"鼓掌，拍手","explanation":"박수：鼓掌，拍手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"박수","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57325","senseId":"1","lemma":"박수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"치더라.","meaning":"拍打，鼓，击","explanation":"치다：拍打，鼓，击；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57323","senseId":"2","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"086a96db168cd21a","term":"훌륭하다","zh":"优秀，卓越","audio":"/audio/086a96db168cd21a589e.mp3","entryId":"73249","definition":"非常好、出色，值得称赞。","pronunciation":["훌륭하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"bc59214ffbb2f1d4","term":"손바닥","zh":"手掌","audio":"/audio/bc59214ffbb2f1d41afe.mp3","entryId":"63968","definition":"手背的相反部分，手的内侧。","pronunciation":["손빠닥"]},{"id":"5c386e3250158aff","term":"닳다","zh":"磨破","audio":"/audio/5c386e3250158aff8a8a.mp3","entryId":"44167","definition":"用久或磨久后某物变旧或长度、厚度和大小等减小。","pronunciation":["달타"]},{"id":"0362ecbd1b937a46","term":"연신","zh":"不断地、一个劲儿地","audio":"/audio/0362ecbd1b937a469a24.mp3","definition":"接连重复同一动作。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"221efccbb32544c1","term":"박수","zh":"鼓掌，拍手","audio":"/audio/221efccbb32544c1820d.mp3","entryId":"57325","definition":"为表示高兴、祝贺、欢迎、称赞等或为打节拍而两手对击。","pronunciation":["박쑤"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"拍打，鼓，击","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"57323","definition":"两手碰撞而发出声音。","pronunciation":["치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/42cbcdac4419ab3dd40a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.22,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63968","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":47,"sequenceScore":2.0467,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我的演奏会怎么样？","很精彩，大家一个劲儿鼓掌，手掌都快拍破了。","智秀，你拿到第一份工资后打算做什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我的演奏会怎么样？","很精彩，大家一个劲儿鼓掌，手掌都快拍破了。","智秀，你拿到第一份工资后打算做什么？"],"answer":1}]}
